    {
      "block_label": "text",
      "block_content": "47. Why do many people seek out scary entertainment, according to the author's research?\nA) They gain experience in overcoming horror in real life.\nB) They find joy in going through simulated horrible experiences.\nC) They have learned from hide-and-seek as kids the thrill involved.\nD) They have evolved to gain pleasure in escaping life-threatening situations.",
      "block_bbox": [
        67,
        920,
        837,
        1070
      ],
      "block_id": 12,
      "block_order": 13,
      "group_id": 12,
      "block_polygon_points": [
        [
          67.0,
          920.0
        ],
        [
          837.0,
          920.0
        ],
        [
          837.0,
          1070.0
        ],
        [
          67.0,
          1070.0
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "block_label": "text",
      "block_content": "48. What do children learn from hide-and-seek?\nA) How to avoid falling prey to an attacker.\nB) How to simulate a predator-prey interaction.\nC) How to keep themselves from catastrophic errors.\nD) How to turn a dangerous scenario into a safe one.",
      "block_bbox": [
        69,
        1076,
        541,
        1225
      ],
      "block_id": 13,
      "block_order": 14,
      "group_id": 13,
      "block_polygon_points": [
        [
          69.0,
