          69.0,
          1225.0
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "block_label": "text",
      "block_content": "49. Why is horror gratifying to many people?\nA) It reminds them of an ancient set of biological defence mechanisms.\nB) It triggers their imagination to travel into dangerous virtual worlds.\nC) It allows them to learn what fear feels like and how to tackle it.\nD) It activates their evolved fear system and their unique fantasy.",
      "block_bbox": [
        69,
        1232,
        692,
        1381
      ],
      "block_id": 14,
      "block_order": 15,
      "group_id": 14,
      "block_polygon_points": [
